</table></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-befa1b7985d4908a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><b>S/A 档逐笔（当日榜去重，档位取自 _学习/_席位分档.json，窗口 20260401~20261028、463 席、基准执1 48.8%/+0.65%）：</b></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-0a63f6634a7a687d"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div id="table-f713a0ae29003172"><table>
